{"type":"text","timestamp":1790379321148,"sessionID":"ses_f251bf6b6ffeWIYIIntuXQvo9d","part":{"id":"prt_0daec67310013xYVinFM3ZJG4q","messageID":"msg_0daec2be30012alZl5v1Sh2S1U","sessionID":"ses_f251bf6b6ffeWIYIIntuXQvo9d","type":"text","text":"The runtime checks passed: stale-state requests are ignored, target tracking stays duplicate-free, the 50 ms threshold resets for each drag, cancelled cards return to their original index, and valid drops remove the card. The screenshots also show the card dragging, returning to the hand, and disappearing after a valid drop.\n","time":{"start":1790379321137,"end":1790379321140},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0f76bd1f89ba432e016ab705371db087d2871296074ce569e2","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790379321164,"sessionID":"ses_f251bf6b6ffeWIYIIntuXQvo9d","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_9c2oBAqKRsqewezeUeSZDNY4","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Delete File: /workspace/.godot/verify_card_drag.gd\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nD workspace/.godot/verify_card_drag.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/.godot/verify_card_drag.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/.godot/verify_card_drag.gd\n+++ /workspace/.godot/verify_card_drag.gd\n@@ -1,132 +0,0 @@\n-extends SceneTree\n-\n-var main\n-var hand\n-var failures := 0\n-\n-\n-func _initialize() -> void:\n-\t_run.call_deferred()\n-\n-\n-func check(condition: bool, message: String) -> void:\n-\tif not condition:\n-\t\tfailures += 1\n-\t\tpush_error(message)\n-\n-\n-func settle() -> void:\n-\tawait physics_frame\n-\tawait physics_frame\n-\tawait process_frame\n-\n-\n-func motion(position: Vector2) -> void:\n-\troot.warp_mouse(position)\n-\tvar event := InputEventMouseMotion.new()\n-\tevent.position = position\n-\tevent.global_position = position\n-\troot.push_input(event, true)\n-\n-\n-func button(position: Vector2, index: MouseButton, pressed: bool) -> void:\n-\troot.warp_mouse(position)\n-\tvar event := InputEventMouseButton.new()\n-\tevent.position = position\n-\tevent.global_position = position\n-\tevent.button_index = index\n-\tevent.pressed = pressed\n-\troot.push_input(event, true)\n-\n-\n-func snapshot(label: String) -> void:\n-\tawait RenderingServer.frame_post_draw\n-\troot.get_texture().get_image().save_png(\"res://.godot/card_drag_%s.png\" % label)\n-\n-\n-func _run() -> void:\n-\tmain = load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate()\n-\troot.add_child(main)\n-\tawait settle()\n-\thand = main.get_node(\"TacticalUI/Cards\")\n-\tvar cards: Array = hand.get_children()\n-\tcheck(cards.size() == 3, \"Harness should create three cards\")\n-\tfor card in cards:\n-\t\tvar machine = card.card_state_machine\n-\t\tcheck(machine.current_state == machine.initial_state, \"Initial state must be entered\")\n-\t\tcheck(not card.drop_point_detector.monitoring, \"Base must disable monitoring\")\n-\t\tcheck(machine.states.size() == 4, \"All four states must be registered\")\n-\t\tfor state in machine.get_children():\n-\t\t\tcheck(state.card_ui == card, \"Each state needs its card reference\")\n-\t\t\tcheck(state.transition_requested.is_connected(machine._on_transition_requested), \"Each transition signal must be connected\")\n-\tawait snapshot(\"initial\")\n-\n-\tvar card = cards[1]\n-\tvar machine = card.card_state_machine\n-\tvar click: Vector2 = card.global_position + Vector2(8, 8)\n-\tmotion(click)\n-\tbutton(click, MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, true)\n-\tcheck(machine.current_state.state == 1, \"GUI click must enter clicked\")\n-\tcheck(card.original_index == 1, \"Clicked must preserve the middle index\")\n-\tcheck(card.drop_point_detector.monitoring, \"Clicked must enable monitoring\")\n-\tmotion(Vector2(100, 60))\n-\tcheck(machine.current_state.state == 2, \"Motion must enter dragging\")\n-\tcheck(card.get_parent() == main.get_node(\"TacticalUI\"), \"Dragging must use the hud_drag_layer group\")\n-\tcheck(card.global_position.is_equal_approx(Vector2(92, 52)), \"Dragging must follow mouse with grab offset: %s, mouse %s, pivot %s\" % [card.global_position, card.get_global_mouse_position(), card.pivot_offset])\n-\tmachine.states[0].transition_requested.emit(machine.states[0], 3)\n-\tcheck(machine.current_state.state == 2, \"Inactive states must not drive transitions\")\n-\tbutton(Vector2(100, 60), MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, false)\n-\tcheck(machine.current_state.state == 2, \"Release before 50ms must be ignored\")\n-\tawait settle()\n-\tcheck(card.targets.has(main.get_node(\"CastArea\")), \"Detector must discover the cast area\")\n-\tcard._on_drop_point_detector_area_entered(main.get_node(\"CastArea\"))\n-\tcheck(card.targets.size() == 1, \"Target entries must be unique\")\n-\tawait snapshot(\"dragging\")\n-\tbutton(Vector2(100, 60), MOUSE_BUTTON_RIGHT, true)\n-\tcheck(machine.current_state.state == 0, \"Right-click must cancel\")\n-\tcheck(card.get_parent() == hand, \"Cancelled card must return to Cards\")\n-\tcheck(hand.get_children() == cards, \"Cancellation must restore original order\")\n-\tcheck(not card.drop_point_detector.monitoring and card.targets.is_empty(), \"Cancellation must reset detector and targets\")\n-\tbutton(Vector2(100, 60), MOUSE_BUTTON_RIGHT, false)\n-\tawait settle()\n-\tawait snapshot(\"cancelled\")\n-\n-\tclick = card.global_position + Vector2(8, 8)\n-\tmotion(click)\n-\tbutton(click, MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, true)\n-\tmotion(Vector2(100, 60))\n-\tawait settle()\n-\tcheck(not card.targets.is_empty(), \"A second drag must detect targets again\")\n-\tmotion(Vector2(100, 140))\n-\tawait settle()\n-\tcheck(card.targets.is_empty(), \"Leaving the cast area must remove the target\")\n-\tawait create_timer(0.06).timeout\n-\tbutton(Vector2(100, 140), MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, false)\n-\tcheck(machine.current_state.state == 3, \"Release after threshold must enter released\")\n-\tcheck(not card.is_queued_for_deletion(), \"Release without a target must preserve the card\")\n-\tawait snapshot(\"released_outside\")\n-\tmotion(Vector2(110, 140))\n-\tcheck(machine.current_state.state == 0, \"Next input after an invalid release must enter base\")\n-\tcheck(hand.get_children() == cards, \"Invalid drop must restore the original order\")\n-\tawait settle()\n-\n-\tclick = card.global_position + Vector2(8, 8)\n-\tmotion(click)\n-\tbutton(click, MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, true)\n-\tbutton(click, MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, false)\n-\tcheck(machine.current_state.state == 0, \"Click without a drag must return to base\")\n-\tbutton(click, MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, true)\n-\tmotion(Vector2(100, 60))\n-\tbutton(Vector2(100, 60), MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT, false)\n-\tcheck(machine.current_state.state == 2, \"Minimum duration mus